      { "sa": "pralayaḥ", "en": "the dissolution" },
      { "sa": "tathā", "en": "likewise" }
    ],
    "translation": "All beings have this as their womb: grasp it thus. I am the origin of the whole world, and likewise the dissolution."
  },
  "7": {
    "words": [
